{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Decision refined 2026-10-27 (operator), superseding the earlier comment on where the repair writes: the repo has no pin-directory concept (no reference to uv-pins anywhere in the tree); that directory is a host convention. So make venv fetches the required uv release into a version-keyed, checksum-verified cache under the repo's own cache directory, and make venv / make install run that copy. The binary found on PATH is never modified."},"env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1793147104058363047,"uuid":"e93a0d80-bcd8-4ad0-a2df-8f67bf64719a"}